DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Irvine Public Library - Heritage Park\\nCost: free
 \\nAges: 0-60 months\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nJoin us for an informative
  talk on perimenopause and menopause\, where you'll learn about the change
 s that occur during this stage of life\, common symptoms\, and strategies 
 for  managing them. Whether you're experiencing this transition yourself o
 r supporting someone who is\, this welcoming program offers practical info
 rmation and an opportunity to ask questions in a supportive environment.  
 Walk-ins welcome. Adults 18 .\\n\\nMore info: https://irvinepubliclibrary.
 libcal.com/event/17547148
LOCATION:Heritage Park Library Community Room \, Heritage Park Library
URL:https://irvinepubliclibrary.libcal.com/event/17547148
